BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:1ec5d687f2854d5d8f6a9320
SUMMARY:The Music of Hans Zimmer
DTSTAMP:20260830T080329Z
DTSTART:20260919T233000Z
DESCRIPTION:Performance Times September 19\, 2026 7:30PM The Cincinnati Pop
	s presents the music of one of cinema's greatest living composers — Hans Z
	immer. From the antics of Captain Jack Sparrow in Pirates of the Caribbean
	 and the eerie\, breathless space of Interstellar\, to the arrival on Arra
	kis in Dune and the battle scenes in Gladiator\, you’ll relive some of the
	 most epic moments from Hans Zimmer’s most enduring film scores. Experienc
	e the musical thrill of these films and more as they’re brought vividly to
	 life with only the sound of the Pops. *Note: this performance does not in
	clude film projections Artists Robert Bernhardt conductor Members of May F
	estival Chorus Matthew Swanson director Members of Vocal Arts Ensemble Joe
	 Miller director Info & Ordering Music Hall Box Office 513-381-3300 1241 E
	lm Street | Cincinnati\, OH 45202 Located in the south entrance of Music H
	all on Elm Street\; free 10-minute parking is available in front of Music 
	Hall. Additional Info and Hours\n\nhttps://www.cincinnatiarts.org/events/d
	etail/the-music-of-hans-zimmer
URL:https://www.cincinnatiarts.org/events/detail/the-music-of-hans-zimmer
LOCATION:Springer Auditorium\, Music Hall
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CATEGORIES:Classical Music
DURATION:PT2H
END:VEVENT
