UID:0ca8e8effe336425632fcd2a
SUMMARY:Psycho in Concert
DTSTAMP:20260830T080329Z
DTSTART:20261027T233000Z
DESCRIPTION:Performance Times October 27\, 2026 7:30PM This Halloween\, you
	’re invited into the shadows for a chilling cinematic experience. Alfred H
	itchcock’s legendary thriller Psycho comes alive on the big screen as its 
	spine-tingling score is performed live-to-film by the Cincinnati Pops. Fro
	m the first ominous notes to the shocking final moments\, Bernard Herrmann
	’s music drives the suspense\, plunging you deep into a world of obsession
	\, secrets and terror. Every scream\, every heartbeat\, every jump scare —
	 heightened by the pulse-pounding effect of a live orchestra. Artists Sara
	h Hicks conductor Info & Ordering Music Hall Box Office 513-381-3300 1241 
	Elm Street | Cincinnati\, OH 45202 Located in the south entrance of Music 
