UID:688c6b4d8c750f33674d90eb
SUMMARY:Conrad Tao\, Mozart & Prokofiev
DTSTAMP:20260830T080329Z
DTSTART:20261204T160000Z
DESCRIPTION:Performance Times December 4\, 2026 11:00AM December 5\, 2026 7
	:30PM Gemma New’s magnetic artistry guides the CSO in a century-spanning c
	elebration of musical imagination. Maria Grenfell’s Bach-infused fugue\, C
	lockwerk\, whirs with playfulness and counterpoint. Cincinnati favorite Co
	nrad Tao joins the Orchestra for Mozart’s Piano Concerto No. 23\, a work w
	hose radiant melodies and intimate lyricism never fail to captivate. Proko
	fiev’s Symphony No. 1 with its charming deceptions and effervescent humor 
	embody the very spirit of neo-classic modernism. The program concludes wit
	h Haydn’s London Symphony\, a crowning achievement of the Classical era. P
	rogram Maria Grenfell Clockwerk Wolfgang Amadeus Mozart Piano Concerto No.
	 23 Sergei Prokofiev Symphony No. 1\, Classical Franz Joseph Haydn Symphon
	y No. 104\, London Artists Gemma New conductor Conrad Tao piano Info & Ord
	ering Music Hall Box Office 513-381-3300 1241 Elm Street | Cincinnati\, OH
	 45202 Located in the south entrance of Music Hall on Elm Street\; free 10
	-minute parking is available in front of Music Hall. Additional Info and H
