DESCRIPTION:Performance Times May 8\, 2027 7:30PM May 9\, 2027 2:00PM Mahle
	r’s final completed symphony is a farewell to life. His vulnerability\, fe
	lt throughout the entire work\, gives way to the humor and tumult of the e
	arthly experiences Mahler knew\, especially in his youth. As we arrive at 
	the profound silence that closes the symphony\, we encounter a composer wh
	o has found peace in accepting his fate. This silence in which he leaves u
	s may be the loudest statement Mahler ever made. Program Gustav Mahler Sym
	phony No. 9 Artists Cristian Mӑcelaru conductor Info & Ordering Music Hall
